            "body": "Portal evidence: an idempotency key is recorded masked, never as its value\n\nThe portal browser test's evidence is committed to ci-evidence, and CI's full-history secret scan reads every branch:\nthe claim's generated idempotencyKey matched gitleaks' generic-api-key rule (9 findings, now in .gitleaksignore).\nrecord() writes \"[masked: N characters]\" in its place. Checked here: the claim tests pass in EN/FR/AR, and gitleaks\n(CI's image) finds nothing in the new evidence while it flags an unmasked control copy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WqJ1WH6TJWfctbXGjyqFZt\n",
